    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Contains extreme sexual depictions. People with heart problems should refrain from playing the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Adult hospital simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3007Overview</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You suffered brain damage in an accident, which resulted in hyperepilation and testicular hypertrophy. It seems that it is incurable, so you have been hospitalized for rehabilitation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3007Game Contents</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Use a random female nurse as you like, selected by your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6In this game, the chance of pregnancy through sexual intercourse has been greatly increased!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Get an EXP bonus if you get a female nurse pregnant! ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6When the mental and libido meters fall below 50, sleep events will occur continuously. Once you've filled up, rest until you have more sperm. (Raise your level as quickly as possible to gain an advantage in the game)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 4 types of pregnancy events (probability of pregnancy through sexual intercourse is about 20%!!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Repeat sexual intercourse to raise your assigned level (additional elements unlocked at assigned level)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Raise your assigned level to enter harem mode! ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3007Erotic elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creampie, doggy style, oral ejaculation, female fall, pregnancy, irrumatio, paizuri, punishment, and many more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3007Characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protagonist - You</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assigned nurse 1 - Kojima Kaede</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assigned nurse 2 - Mashiro Megu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assigned nurse 3 - Azekawa Rin</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assigned nurse 4 - Mado Rizeru</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bUpdates and DLC are planned for the future to further increase the volume? .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbImages are created using AI tools. Below are the AI \u200b\u200btools used and the main tools used:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI tool used: PixArt</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Painting tool used: MediBang Paint</p>",
